    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "A lesser cutting of the Queen's own staff, taken before the wood had finished dying. It keeps her sight and her cold and lost her fire. Balanced as a walking-staff rather than a sceptre, it answers a fighting grip as readily as a spellcaster's."
    }
  },
